chud With the National Council's rejection of Stegerwald, the party's close relations with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> has led the delegates to nominate Joseph Joos as chairman to continue further cooperation with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>. As chairman of the Catholic Workers Associations and de-facto leader of the <span style="color: #FF7F00;">Christian Left</span>, he increases the appeal of the <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span> to workers and progressives. 

